  "id": "mango-lab",
  "after": "studySteps",
  "title": "Step 4, the mango Lab: your rule vs the machine's rule.",
  "caption": "Each mango is placed by skin colour and softness, and the seller has labelled it ripe or not ripe. Your hand-made rule (नियम, niyam) \"soft means ripe\" misses firm yellow mangoes. The machine learns a slanted line from the labels and gets more right. These dots are made up.",
  "alt": "A chart of 16 mangoes. Left to right is skin colour from green to yellow; bottom to top is softness from hard to soft. Yellow circles are ripe and green diamonds are not ripe. A dashed horizontal line is your rule, soft means ripe; it wrongly calls some soft green mangoes ripe and misses firm yellow ones. A solid slanted line is the rule the machine learned from the labels, and it separates the two kinds much better.",
  "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 338\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"52\" y=\"30\" width=\"288\" height=\"200\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-surface2\"/><line x1=\"52\" y1=\"230\" x2=\"340\" y2=\"230\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"52\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"52\" y2=\"230\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"46\" y=\"42\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"end\">soft</text><text x=\"46\" y=\"228\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"end\">hard</text><text x=\"52\" y=\"250\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">green</text><text x=\"340\" y=\"250\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"end\">yellow</text><text x=\"196\" y=\"250\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\">skin colour</text><line x1=\"52\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"340\" y2=\"110\" class=\"s-sindoor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\"/><line x1=\"124\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"291\" y2=\"229\" class=\"s-indigo\" stroke-width=\"2.6\"/><circle cx=\"253.6\" cy=\"70\" r=\"6\" class=\"f-s3 s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"282.4\" cy=\"100\" r=\"6\" class=\"f-s3 s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"311.2\" cy=\"150\" r=\"6\" class=\"f-s3 s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"224.8\" cy=\"80\" r=\"6\" class=\"f-s3 s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"296.8\" cy=\"54\" r=\"6\" class=\"f-s3 s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"268\" cy=\"160\" r=\"6\" class=\"f-s3 s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"317\" cy=\"186\" r=\"6\" class=\"f-s3 s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"213.3\" cy=\"50\" r=\"6\" class=\"f-s3 s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><path d=\"M80.8 183L87.8 190L80.8 197L73.8 190Z\" class=\"f-s4 s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><path d=\"M109.6 143L116.6 150L109.6 157L102.6 150Z\" class=\"f-s4 s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><path d=\"M138.4 193L145.4 200L138.4 207L131.4 200Z\" class=\"f-s4 s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><path d=\"M95.2 91L102.2 98L95.2 105L88.2 98Z\" class=\"f-s4 s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><path d=\"M167.2 163L174.2 170L167.2 177L160.2 170Z\" class=\"f-s4 s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><path d=\"M98.1 55L105.1 62L98.1 69L91.1 62Z\" class=\"f-s4 s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><path d=\"M196 203L203 210L196 217L189 210Z\" class=\"f-s4 s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><path d=\"M152.8 123L159.8 130L152.8 137L145.8 130Z\" class=\"f-s4 s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"14\" y1=\"271\" x2=\"44\" y2=\"271\" class=\"s-sindoor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\"/><text x=\"52\" y=\"276\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\">Your rule: \"soft = ripe\"</text><line x1=\"14\" y1=\"295\" x2=\"44\" y2=\"295\" class=\"s-indigo\" stroke-width=\"2.6\"/><text x=\"52\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\">Machine's rule: learned from labels</text><circle cx=\"22\" cy=\"321\" r=\"6\" class=\"f-s3 s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"326\" font-size=\"13\">ripe</text><path d=\"M100 314L107 321L100 328L93 321Z\" class=\"f-s4 s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"326\" font-size=\"13\">not ripe (labels from the seller)</text></svg>"
