 {
  "id": "india-ai-by-type",
  "after": "indiaExample",
  "title": "Indian AI uses, sorted by type.",
  "caption": "Ask one question for each use: does it learn from answers, find groups, or learn from rewards? MuleHunter.AI is a real RBIH tool; the others are common kinds of uses, not named products.",
  "alt": "Three columns. Supervised, has answers: MuleHunter.AI for mule accounts, UPI fraud alerts, crop yield guess, exam result predictor. Unsupervised, no answers: kirana buyer groups, similar complaints, odd payments that stand out. Reinforcement, gets rewards: a game bot that plays Ludo, a robot that finds a fast path. A last line says supervised learning is very common in business.",
  "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 308\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"110\" height=\"30\" rx=\"15\" class=\"f-indigo-soft s-indigo\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"63\" y=\"27.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Supervised</text><text x=\"63\" y=\"58\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\">has answers</text><rect x=\"8\" y=\"70\" width=\"110\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface2 s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"63\" y=\"88\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">MuleHunter.AI</text><text x=\"63\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">mule accounts</text><rect x=\"8\" y=\"122\" width=\"110\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface2 s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"63\" y=\"140.1\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">UPI fraud</text><text x=\"63\" y=\"157.1\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">alerts</text><rect x=\"8\" y=\"174\" width=\"110\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface2 s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"63\" y=\"192.1\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">Crop yield</text><text x=\"63\" y=\"209.1\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">guess</text><rect x=\"8\" y=\"226\" width=\"110\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface2 s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"63\" y=\"244.1\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">Exam result</text><text x=\"63\" y=\"261.1\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">predictor</text><rect x=\"125\" y=\"8\" width=\"110\" height=\"30\" rx=\"15\" class=\"f-haldi-soft s-haldi\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"27.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Unsupervised</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"58\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\">no answers</text><rect x=\"125\" y=\"70\" width=\"110\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface2 s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"88\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">Kirana buyer</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">groups</text><rect x=\"125\" y=\"122\" width=\"110\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface2 s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"140.1\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">Similar</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"157.1\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">complaints</text><rect x=\"125\" y=\"174\" width=\"110\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface2 s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"192.1\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">Odd payments</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"209.1\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">that stand out</text><rect x=\"242\" y=\"8\" width=\"110\" height=\"30\" rx=\"15\" class=\"f-ok-soft s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"297\" y=\"27.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Reinforcement</text><text x=\"297\" y=\"58\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\">gets rewards</text><rect x=\"242\" y=\"70\" width=\"110\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface2 s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"297\" y=\"88\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">Game bot</text><text x=\"297\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">plays Ludo</text><rect x=\"242\" y=\"122\" width=\"110\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface2 s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"297\" y=\"140.1\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">Robot finds</text><text x=\"297\" y=\"157.1\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">a fast path</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"296\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Supervised is very common in business.</text></svg>"
 },
 {
  "id": "language-data-gap",
  "after": "indiaExample",
  "title": "Why AI for Bhojpuri is harder than for English.",
  "caption": "A model learns only from data. Much less text and speech exists online for many Indian languages (भाषा, bhasha). So groups like AI4Bharat at IIT Madras collect open data; its IndicVoices set has over 7,000 hours of speech in 22 languages.",
  "alt": "Three bars, not to scale: English has a huge amount of text and speech data online, Hindi less, Bhojpuri very little. A flow follows: less data to learn from, so the model learns less, so it makes more mistakes. The fix: build open data, like AI4Bharat IndicVoices with over 7,000 hours of speech in 22 Indian languages.",
  "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 318\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><text x=\"12\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">Text and speech data online</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"41\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">Not to scale: it only shows the idea.</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"71\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\">English</text><rect x=\"84\" y=\"56\" width=\"220\" height=\"20\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-s1\"/><text x=\"312\" y=\"71\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">huge</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"103\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\">Hindi</text><rect x=\"84\" y=\"88\" width=\"90\" height=\"20\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-s1\"/><text x=\"182\" y=\"103\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">less</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"135\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\">Bhojpuri</text><rect x=\"84\" y=\"120\" width=\"12\" height=\"20\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-s1\"/><text x=\"104\" y=\"135\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">very little</text><rect x=\"8\" y=\"168\" width=\"104\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-bad-soft s-bad\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"186.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Less data</text><text x=\"60\" y=\"204.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">to learn from</text><line x1=\"113\" y1=\"191\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"191\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><polygon points=\"127,191 119,195.4 119,186.6\" class=\"f-muted\"/><rect x=\"128\" y=\"168\" width=\"104\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-bad-soft s-bad\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"186.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Model learns</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"204.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">less</text><line x1=\"233\" y1=\"191\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"191\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><polygon points=\"247,191 239,195.4 239,186.6\" class=\"f-muted\"/><rect x=\"248\" y=\"168\" width=\"104\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-bad-soft s-bad\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"186.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">More</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"204.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">mistakes</text><line x1=\"180\" y1=\"216\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"231\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><polygon points=\"180,238 175.6,230 184.4,230\" class=\"f-muted\"/><rect x=\"8\" y=\"240\" width=\"344\" height=\"70\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-ok-soft s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"261.9\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Fix: build open data</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"279.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">AI4Bharat IndicVoices: 7,000+ hours</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"297.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">of speech in 22 Indian languages</text></svg>"
 },
 {
  "id": "accuracy-trap",
  "after": "commonMistakes",
  "title": "The 99.5% trap.",
  "caption": "Fraud is rare, so a lazy model that always says \"genuine\" is right 199 times out of 200. Its accuracy (सटीकता, sateekta) is 99.5%, but it catches zero fraud. Always check how many real frauds a model catches.",
  "alt": "A grid of 200 dots for 200 UPI payments: 199 green dots are genuine and one red dot is fraud, which is 0.5 percent. A lazy model always says genuine. Its accuracy is 199 out of 200, 99.5 percent, which looks great, but it catches 0 out of 1 fraud, so it is useless.",
  "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 402\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><text x=\"12\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">200 UPI payments: only 1 is fraud</text><defs><pattern id=\"l1aib-dots\" x=\"20\" y=\"34\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"8\" r=\"5\" class=\"f-ok\"/></pattern></defs><rect x=\"20\" y=\"34\" width=\"320\" height=\"160\" fill=\"url(#l1aib-dots)\"/><circle cx=\"236\" cy=\"106\" r=\"7.5\" class=\"f-surface\"/><circle cx=\"236\" cy=\"106\" r=\"5.5\" class=\"f-bad\"/><circle cx=\"236\" cy=\"106\" r=\"11\" class=\"f-none s-bad\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"213\" r=\"5\" class=\"f-ok\"/><text x=\"38\" y=\"218\" font-size=\"13\">genuine: 199</text><circle cx=\"156\" cy=\"213\" r=\"5\" class=\"f-bad\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"218\" font-size=\"13\">fraud: 1 (0.5%)</text><rect x=\"8\" y=\"232\" width=\"344\" height=\"38\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface2 s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"255.9\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Lazy model: always says \"genuine\"</text><line x1=\"90\" y1=\"270\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"283\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><polygon points=\"90,290 85.6,282 94.4,282\" class=\"f-muted\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"270\" x2=\"270\" y2=\"283\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><polygon points=\"270,290 265.6,282 274.4,282\" class=\"f-muted\"/><rect x=\"8\" y=\"292\" width=\"164\" height=\"70\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-ok-soft s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"90\" y=\"313.9\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Accuracy</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"331.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">199 / 200 = 99.5%</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"349.6\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\">looks great</text><rect x=\"188\" y=\"292\" width=\"164\" height=\"70\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-bad-soft s-bad\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"313.9\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Frauds caught</text><text x=\"270\" y=\"331.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0 out of 1</text><text x=\"270\" y=\"349.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">useless!</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"390\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Always ask: how many frauds did it catch?</text></svg>"
 },
 {
  "id": "bias-from-data",
  "after": "commonMistakes",
  "title": "How old data teaches an unfair pattern.",
  "caption": "The numbers are made up. Nobody wrote a rule against women. The model copied the pattern in ten years of past hiring. The fix is to check the data, remove hidden clues to gender (like a women-only college name), and compare scores for each group.",
  "alt": "Step 1: ten person icons for past hires; nine are men and one is a woman. Step 2: the model learns that a good CV looks like past hires. Step 3: two new CVs with the same skill, 5 years of Java; Ravi gets a score of 82 and Priya gets 54. Fix: check the data first, remove hidden clues to gender, and compare scores for each group.",
  "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 382\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><text x=\"12\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">1. Past hiring data (10 years)</text><circle cx=\"36\" cy=\"40\" r=\"5.5\" class=\"f-indigo\"/><path d=\"M28 60Q28 48 36 48Q44 48 44 60Z\" class=\"f-indigo\"/><circle cx=\"68\" cy=\"40\" r=\"5.5\" class=\"f-indigo\"/><path d=\"M60 60Q60 48 68 48Q76 48 76 60Z\" class=\"f-indigo\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"40\" r=\"5.5\" class=\"f-indigo\"/><path d=\"M92 60Q92 48 100 48Q108 48 108 60Z\" class=\"f-indigo\"/><circle cx=\"132\" cy=\"40\" r=\"5.5\" class=\"f-indigo\"/><path d=\"M124 60Q124 48 132 48Q140 48 140 60Z\" class=\"f-indigo\"/><circle cx=\"164\" cy=\"40\" r=\"5.5\" class=\"f-indigo\"/><path d=\"M156 60Q156 48 164 48Q172 48 172 60Z\" class=\"f-indigo\"/><circle cx=\"196\" cy=\"40\" r=\"5.5\" class=\"f-indigo\"/><path d=\"M188 60Q188 48 196 48Q204 48 204 60Z\" class=\"f-indigo\"/><circle cx=\"228\" cy=\"40\" r=\"5.5\" class=\"f-indigo\"/><path d=\"M220 60Q220 48 228 48Q236 48 236 60Z\" class=\"f-indigo\"/><circle cx=\"260\" cy=\"40\" r=\"5.5\" class=\"f-indigo\"/><path d=\"M252 60Q252 48 260 48Q268 48 268 60Z\" class=\"f-indigo\"/><circle cx=\"292\" cy=\"40\" r=\"5.5\" class=\"f-indigo\"/><path d=\"M284 60Q284 48 292 48Q300 48 300 60Z\" class=\"f-indigo\"/><circle cx=\"324\" cy=\"40\" r=\"5.5\" class=\"f-haldi\"/><path d=\"M316 60Q316 48 324 48Q332 48 332 60Z\" class=\"f-haldi\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"82\" r=\"5\" class=\"f-indigo\"/><text x=\"40\" y=\"87\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">men hired</text><circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"82\" r=\"5\" class=\"f-haldi\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"87\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">women hired</text><line x1=\"180\" y1=\"96\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"107\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><polygon points=\"180,114 175.6,106 184.4,106\" class=\"f-muted\"/><rect x=\"30\" y=\"116\" width=\"300\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface2 s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"136.9\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">2. The model learns</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"154.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\"good CV = looks like past hires\"</text><line x1=\"180\" y1=\"166\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"177\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><polygon points=\"180,184 175.6,176 184.4,176\" class=\"f-muted\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"204\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">3. Two new CVs, same skills</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"216\" width=\"160\" height=\"70\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-ok-soft s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"92\" y=\"237.9\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Ravi</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"255.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5 years of Java</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"273.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">score: 82</text><rect x=\"188\" y=\"216\" width=\"160\" height=\"70\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-bad-soft s-bad\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"268\" y=\"237.9\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Priya</text><text x=\"268\" y=\"255.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5 years of Java</text><text x=\"268\" y=\"273.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">score: 54</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"302\" width=\"336\" height=\"70\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface2 s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"323.9\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Fix: check the data first</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"341.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">remove hidden clues to gender,</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"359.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">compare scores for each group</text></svg>"
 },
 {
  "id": "punjab-to-kerala",
  "after": "commonMistakes",
  "title": "A model trained in one place may fail in another.",
  "caption": "The model learned Punjab patterns: wheat and rice, less rain. Kerala has heavy monsoon rain, laterite soil (मिट्टी, mitti) and crops like rubber and coconut. So the old patterns do not fit. A bigger model will not help; Kerala data will.",
  "alt": "Left box: trained on Punjab, wheat and rice, less rain, river-plain soil. An arrow leads to the right box: used in Kerala, rubber and coconut, heavy monsoon, laterite soil. Result: poor advice, because the learned patterns do not fit. Fix: collect Kerala data, then train again.",
  "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 312\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"160\" height=\"130\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-haldi-soft s-haldi\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"88\" y=\"44.9\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Trained on Punjab</text><text x=\"88\" y=\"66.5\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">wheat and rice</text><text x=\"88\" y=\"88.5\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">less rain</text><text x=\"88\" y=\"110.5\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">river-plain soil</text><rect x=\"192\" y=\"8\" width=\"160\" height=\"130\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-indigo-soft s-indigo\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"272\" y=\"44.9\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Used in Kerala</text><text x=\"272\" y=\"66.5\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">rubber, coconut</text><text x=\"272\" y=\"88.5\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">heavy monsoon</text><text x=\"272\" y=\"110.5\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">laterite soil</text><line x1=\"169\" y1=\"73\" x2=\"183\" y2=\"73\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><polygon points=\"190,73 182,77.4 182,68.6\" class=\"f-muted\"/><line x1=\"272\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"272\" y2=\"155\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><polygon points=\"272,162 267.6,154 276.4,154\" class=\"f-muted\"/><rect x=\"8\" y=\"164\" width=\"344\" height=\"56\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-bad-soft s-bad\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"187.9\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Poor advice</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"205.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">the learned patterns do not fit</text><line x1=\"180\" y1=\"222\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"237\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><polygon points=\"180,244 175.6,236 184.4,236\" class=\"f-muted\"/><rect x=\"8\" y=\"246\" width=\"344\" height=\"56\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-ok-soft s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"269.9\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Fix</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"287.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">collect Kerala data, then train again</text></svg>"
 },
 {
  "id": "which-type",
  "after": "selfCheck",
  "title": "Which type of learning is it?",
  "caption": "Ask two questions in order. Does each example have the right answer? Then it is supervised. If not, does it learn by acting and getting rewards? Then it is reinforcement learning; otherwise it is unsupervised.",
  "alt": "A decision tree. First question: does each example come with the right answer? Yes leads to supervised, for example fraud or not. No leads to a second question: does it learn by acting and getting rewards? Yes leads to reinforcement, for example a game bot. No leads to unsupervised, for example groups. A worked example: group kirana buyers has no answers and no rewards, so it is unsupervised.",
  "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 358\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"30\" y=\"8\" width=\"300\" height=\"54\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-indigo-soft s-indigo\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"30.9\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Does each example come</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"48.9\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">with the right answer?</text><rect x=\"8\" y=\"104\" width=\"152\" height=\"58\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-ok-soft s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"84\" y=\"128.9\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Supervised</text><text x=\"84\" y=\"146.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">e.g. fraud or not</text><rect x=\"176\" y=\"104\" width=\"176\" height=\"58\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-indigo-soft s-indigo\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"264\" y=\"128.9\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Does it learn by</text><text x=\"264\" y=\"146.9\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">acting + rewards?</text><line x1=\"110\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"89.6\" y2=\"96\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><polygon points=\"86,102 86.3,92.9 93.9,97.4\" class=\"f-muted\"/><text x=\"90\" y=\"88\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"700\">Yes</text><line x1=\"250\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"260\" y2=\"95.3\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><polygon points=\"262,102 255.5,95.6 263.9,93.1\" class=\"f-muted\"/><text x=\"264\" y=\"84\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">No</text><rect x=\"104\" y=\"208\" width=\"132\" height=\"58\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-ok-soft s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"232.9\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Reinforcement</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"250.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">e.g. a game bot</text><rect x=\"246\" y=\"208\" width=\"106\" height=\"58\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-ok-soft s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"299\" y=\"232.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Unsupervised</text><text x=\"299\" y=\"250.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">e.g. groups</text><line x1=\"230\" y1=\"162\" x2=\"200.3\" y2=\"200.5\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><polygon points=\"196,206 197.4,197 204.4,202.4\" class=\"f-muted\"/><text x=\"204\" y=\"188\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"700\">Yes</text><line x1=\"310\" y1=\"162\" x2=\"304.9\" y2=\"199.1\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><polygon points=\"304,206 300.7,197.5 309.4,198.7\" class=\"f-muted\"/><text x=\"314\" y=\"190\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">No</text><rect x=\"8\" y=\"290\" width=\"344\" height=\"58\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface2 s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"314.9\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Try: \"group kirana buyers\"</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"332.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">answers? No. Rewards? No. So: unsupervised</text></svg>"
 },
 {
  "id": "consent-checklist",
  "after": "selfCheck",
  "title": "Asking for consent the DPDP way.",
  "caption": "A good consent (सहमति, sahmati) screen says what data you want and why, and gives a real choice. Under the DPDP Act, the person is the Data Principal and the company is the Data Fiduciary.",
  "alt": "A phone screen from a tuition app: we need your phone number only to send class updates, with buttons Allow and No thanks, and a note that you can change your choice anytime in Settings. Below, a six-step checklist: say what and why, ask a clear yes, use it only for that, take only the data that is needed, keep it safe, let them withdraw. A note says you are the Data Principal and the company is the Data Fiduciary.",
  "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 384\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"66\" y=\"8\" width=\"228\" height=\"182\" rx=\"18\" class=\"f-surface2 s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><rect x=\"150\" y=\"16\" width=\"60\" height=\"6\" rx=\"3\" class=\"f-line\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"46\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Asha Tuition app</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">We need your phone number</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"88\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">only to send class updates.</text><rect x=\"84\" y=\"104\" width=\"90\" height=\"32\" rx=\"16\" class=\"f-indigo-soft s-indigo\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"129\" y=\"124.9\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Allow</text><rect x=\"186\" y=\"104\" width=\"90\" height=\"32\" rx=\"16\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"231\" y=\"124.9\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">No thanks</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Change your choice anytime</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"178\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\">in Settings.</text><circle cx=\"22\" cy=\"222\" r=\"12\" class=\"f-ok-soft s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"227\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">1</text><text x=\"40\" y=\"227\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\">Say what and why</text><circle cx=\"22\" cy=\"258\" r=\"12\" class=\"f-ok-soft s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"263\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">2</text><text x=\"40\" y=\"263\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\">Ask a clear yes</text><circle cx=\"22\" cy=\"294\" r=\"12\" class=\"f-ok-soft s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"299\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">3</text><text x=\"40\" y=\"299\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\">Use it only for that</text><circle cx=\"186\" cy=\"222\" r=\"12\" class=\"f-ok-soft s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"186\" y=\"227\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">4</text><text x=\"204\" y=\"227\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\">Take only needed data</text><circle cx=\"186\" cy=\"258\" r=\"12\" class=\"f-ok-soft s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"186\" y=\"263\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">5</text><text x=\"204\" y=\"263\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\">Keep it safe</text><circle cx=\"186\" cy=\"294\" r=\"12\" class=\"f-ok-soft s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"186\" y=\"299\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">6</text><text x=\"204\" y=\"299\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\">Let them withdraw</text><rect x=\"8\" y=\"318\" width=\"344\" height=\"56\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-haldi-soft s-haldi\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"341.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">You = the Data Principal</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"359.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">The company = the Data Fiduciary</text></svg>"
 }
